{"4143670": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "12 Memory Lane", "steam_appid": 4143670, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 Memory Lane is a first-person narrative mystery game. Step inside the  manor of the elusive Henry Villemaine and piece together the slices of life leading up to the sudden disappearance of his family.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE AN EVER-SHIFTING MANSION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Henry Villemaine’s mansion is constantly shifting : faces change in photographs, furniture moves when you’re not looking... Use post-it notes to mark objects and keep them fixed in place as you explore.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RECREATE SCENES FROM A FRAGMENTED JOURNAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Henry’s personal journal is your only trustworthy guide. Through its pages, relive intimate moments of family life and interpret his memories to restore each room, deducing the correct placement of furniture and objects.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNCOVER UNSPOKEN FAMILY SECRETS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every room holds the silent truth of a member of the Villemaine family. Set the mansion right to reveal long-buried secrets… and uncover whether your role in this mystery is more than that of a simple investigator.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 Memory Lane is a first-person narrative mystery game. Step inside the  manor of the elusive Henry Villemaine and piece together the slices of life leading up to the sudden disappearance of his family.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE AN EVER-SHIFTING MANSION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Henry Villemaine’s mansion is constantly shifting : faces change in photographs, furniture moves when you’re not looking... Use post-it notes to mark objects and keep them fixed in place as you explore.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RECREATE SCENES FROM A FRAGMENTED JOURNAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Henry’s personal journal is your only trustworthy guide. Through its pages, relive intimate moments of family life and interpret his memories to restore each room, deducing the correct placement of furniture and objects.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNCOVER UNSPOKEN FAMILY SECRETS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every room holds the silent truth of a member of the Villemaine family. Set the mansion right to reveal long-buried secrets… and uncover whether your role in this mystery is more than that of a simple investigator.</p>", "short_description": "Explore the shifting manor of the enigmatic Henri Villemaine and uncover the truth behind his family’s sudden disappearance. Bend reality to recreate the scenes from his diary and expose long-buried secrets. What if your role in this case went beyond that of a simple investigator?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143670/aa67194919e69b02094ebef33f8d64d685fb53d9/header.jpg?t=1773245539", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143670/7c876ce8028165b41902dbc55b236811ea2a0b3e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773245539", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143670/7c876ce8028165b41902dbc55b236811ea2a0b3e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773245539", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 x64<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 10th gen<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1080<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Forget-Me-Not Studio"], "publishers": ["Rubika Supinfogame"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "